menu "Re:Kernel"

config REKERNEL
	bool "Re:Kernel support"
	depends on NET
	default y
	help
	  Report binder transactions and fatal signals aimed at frozen
	  tasks over a netlink socket, so that a userspace daemon can
	  thaw the target before it is killed.  Make tombstone users get
	  a better experience.

config REKERNEL_NETWORK
	bool "Re:Kernel NetReceive unfreeze support"
	depends on REKERNEL && NETFILTER
	default y
	help
	  Also report inbound TCP segments carrying payload, SYN, FIN or
	  RST that are destined for an application uid, so that a frozen
	  application can be thawed for incoming traffic.  This installs
	  an NF_INET_LOCAL_IN hook on the ipv4 and ipv6 families.

endmenu
